W
  ====
  - [[Page~136 (1)勾 _(1)Kau_ (gau1); here normalised to _(1)Ngau_ (ngau1)]]
    ==
    - To reject;
    - to blot or strike out;
    - to mark off for punishment;
    - to inveigh, to entice;
    - crooked, hooked;
    - _~~(1)kau~~ ``(1)ngau`` ~~k(u:)t(8)~~ ``k(')(u:)t(8)``_
        [[ngau1 kyut3]]
        to mark off for execution;
    - _~~(1)kau~~ ``(1)ngau`` (4)ch(')(u:)_
        [[ngau1 ceoi4]],
        to mark out from a list items wanted;
    - _~~(1)kau~~ ``(1)ngau`` tong(3)_
        [[ngau1 dong3]]
        business, affairs;
        underhand, illegal doings;
    - _~~(1)kau~~ ``(1)ngau`` (1)ch(i/) (2)fan_
        [[ngau1 zi1 fan2]],
        to fondle women, lustful dalliance;
    - _~~(1)kau~~ ``(1)ngau`` ~~(2)yan~~ ``(5)yan``_
        [[ngau1 jan5]],
        to seduce to evil, to entice;
    - _~~(1)kau~~ ``(1)ngau`` ~~(1)shang~~ ``(1)sh(a/)ng`` (i/)(3)_
        [[ngau1 saang1 ji3]]
        to fish for custom.
    ==
    --
    Often interchanged with the next [[鉤]].
    --
  ====
$$
